SUMMARY:The Long Weekend\, Mix\, Mingle and Dinner Party (Sunday\, August 
 2nd)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nI hope you're all having a wonderful week!\n\nI'm looking forward to br
 inging everyone together for a fun evening of great food\, easy conversati
 on\, and the chance to meet some fantastic new people at our \\*\\*Long We
 ekend\, Mix\, Mingle and Dinner Party\\*\\*.\n\n\\*Joined by my other soci
 al groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of frie
 ndly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Ph
 easant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawr
 ence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area or on the patio\
 , depending on weather and numbers)**\n\n*\\*You can ask the bartender if 
 you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's dinner party)*\n
 \n-You'll find it's a cozy\, relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere!\n\n**-Free 
 Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSi
 ncerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**🎉 T
 he Long Weekend\, Mix\, Mingle and Dinner Party (Sunday\, August 2nd)**\n\
 nCelebrate the long weekend with a relaxed evening of great food\, engagin
 g conversation\, and the chance to meet new people in a welcoming atmosphe
 re. Whether you're coming on your own or with a friend\, this is the perfe
 ct opportunity to enjoy good company\, share some laughs\, and make meanin
 gful new connections over dinner.\nWhat to expect:\n\\* 🍽️ Enjoy a de
 licious dinner while meeting friendly\, like-minded people\n\\* 😊 Fun i
 cebreakers and easy conversation to help everyone feel welcome\n\\* 🤝 A
  great opportunity to make new friends and expand your social circle\n\\* 
 🎉 A relaxed\, upbeat evening filled with laughter\, conversation\, and 
 long weekend fun!\nCome with a smile\, an open mind\, and a willingness to
  meet some amazing people. Looking forward to seeing you there!\n\\*\\*Hos
 ted by Steve Flemming\\*\\*\n\n**Event Fee:** 5 dollars (Cash only at the 
 door) (HST included)\nor by e transfer: **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n*
 **\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 7:00 pm and 7:45
  pm (if you can) (please ask for Steve when you arrive- we will either be 
 inside or on the patio-depending on weather and our numbers)\n\n\\*Great d
 inner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum
  upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lot
 s of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps://www.fi
 rkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawr
 ence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
