SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart (August 6th) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for an inspiring and soulful experience with **Songs with H
 eart!**\n\nSongs about people\, love\, romance\, loss\, nature\, the futur
 e\, the past\, the present\, spirituality and the search for meaning in li
 fe :)\n\nCheck out one or more of my songs here too :)\nhttps://youtu.be/v
 ei1PDucWoM?si=fHuM7nH3qBaDzi5c\n\nDo you appreciate?\n\n* Thoughtful songw
 riting\n* Folk music\, country and soft rock storytelling\n* Life reflecti
 on and meaningful lyrics\n* Songs that help you understand yourself better
 \n\nIf so\, you have come to the right place :)\n\nThese are songs about o
 rdinary people\, extraordinary moments\, beautiful imagery\, and the searc
 h for what is real.\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time starting at 
 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Fle
 mming\n(Canadian Folk\, Country and Adult Contemporary)\nhttps://www.youtu
 be.com/@SteveFlemmingSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming Presents: S
 ongs with Heart (Thursday\, August 6th)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\nSteve Flemming
 's songs explore the human experience through storytelling\, reflection\, 
 imagination\, and heartfelt observation. Drawing from folk\, country\, roc
 k\, blue eyed soul\, and singer-songwriter traditions\, his work touches o
 n themes of love\, loss\, hope\, resilience\, freedom\, social awareness\,
  personal growth\, spirituality\, and the search for meaning. His songs of
 ten feature memorable characters\, everyday moments\, philosophical questi
 ons\, and a deep curiosity about life and human nature. Whether telling a 
 story\, sharing a life lesson\, expressing a romantic sentiment\, or refle
 cting on the state of the world\, his music seeks to inspire thought\, con
 nection\, compassion\, and a greater appreciation for the journey we all s
 hare\n\n**Songs containing:**\n\n* Memorable characters\n* Emotional hones
 ty\n* Genuine craftsmanship\n\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nSteve Flemming 
 is a prolific folk-country songwriter\; whose songs explore ordinary peopl
 e\, gratitude\, personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality\, and the sear
 ch for meaning.\n\n**A little more about Steve the songwriter:**\nHis song
 s explore freedom\, awareness\, love\, consciousness\, and the simple wisd
 om hidden in ordinary life.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n*
 *Pay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or 
 pay pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute
  is greatly appreciated to help support these wonderful intimate evenings 
 among music lovers and friends\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us
 /j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-
